From c3421cbdde06a16cfbbd349b9837df05ffef15ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:06:54 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] kcm_webshortcuts: list first, clearer button and option
 labels (QtWidgets kept)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: List (docs/page-design.md sections 1, 4, 8). Stays QtWidgets (ui file edit only). The provider list with its search
field and buttons now comes right after the master checkbox; Default search engine, Keyword delimiter and the preferred-only
checkbox move below the list (the checkbox used to sit between master switch and list). Settings, kuriikwsfilterrc keys and
providers unchanged.

Renamed (inventory/relabel/kcm_webshortcuts.tsv): 'Enable Web search keywords' -> 'Use web search keywords';
'Use preferred keywords only' -> 'Only show preferred keywords'; 'New…' -> 'Add Keyword…'; 'Delete' -> 'Remove';
'Default Web search keyword:' -> 'Default search engine:'. Page name unchanged, so no new aliases. ksr: markers in the ui files.

Speed (from code): FilterOptions::load() reads every provider .desktop file synchronously (ikwsopts.cpp:319); not changed,
needs a worker thread, too risky unbuilt. After: pending, manager will measure.

HIG: HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-019.

Not built yet (freeze). Grid row/colspan changes in the .ui unverified visually.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
